        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WDP30, Sliding Door Locking Pin</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese 3\" long locking pins are used on sliding doors or sliding windows. They include a retention chain to prevent loss of the pin when unlocked. Also included are a bezel plate for the lock pin hole  and screw for the chain.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-finish-64036.jpg?v=1704442279\" width=\"175\" height=\"175\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Sliding Door Locking Pin\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WDP30-specifications.gif?v=1704354668\" width=\"585\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DEL-WDP30 Sliding Door Locking Pin Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEasy to install on sliding windows or doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3\" Sliding Glass Door Lock Pin:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pin material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Pin Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pin Diameter: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pin Holder Length: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pin Holder Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WDP30-specifications.pdf?v=1704262231\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WDP30 Sliding Door or Window Locking Pin Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
